      "correct_option": "C",
      "explanation": "Using the power rule: d/dx(4x\u2075) = 20x\u2074, d/dx(-3x\u00b3) = -9x\u00b2, d/dx(2x) = 2, d/dx(-7) = 0. So f'(x) = 20x\u2074 - 9x\u00b2 + 2."
